    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177,
        1506,
        1491,
        1623
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, crashes involving City fleet and contractor vehicles can have an incalculable human cost, and also delay and disrupt the provision of critical services to the public and require time-consuming and costly repairs; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
